return ['domain'=>'zinn-translate','plural-forms'=>'nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);','language'=>'uz_UZ','project-id-version'=>'zinn-translate','pot-creation-date'=>'2026-09-08T11:06:41+00:00','po-revision-date'=>'2026-09-08T11:06:41+00:00','x-generator'=>'scripts/wp-i18n-translate.py','messages'=>['Zinn® Translate'=>'Zinn® Translate','https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate'=>'https://zinndigital.com/wordpress-plugins/zinn-translate','Publishes this site in every language you choose, on its own web addresses, with translated slugs, metadata, menus, WooCommerce products, hreflang, per-language sitemaps and llms.txt. Translate with your Zinn Digital® plan or with your own provider key.'=>'Bu saytni siz tanlagan har bir tilda, oʻz veb-manzillarida, tarjima qilingan sluglar, metamaʼlumotlar, menyular, WooCommerce mahsulotlari, hreflang, har bir til uchun sayt xaritalari va llms.txt bilan nashr qiladi. Zinn Digital® rejangiz yordamida yoki oʻz provayderingiz kaliti bilan tarjima qiling.','Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd'=>'Neil Lock — CEO, Zinn Digital® Ltd','https://zinndigital.com'=>'https://zinndigital.com','Translate'=>'Tarjima qilish','Manual overrides'=>'Qo\'lda bekor qilishlar','Sitemaps and URLs'=>'Sayt xaritalari va URL manzillari','General'=>'Umumiy','Who pays for the translation'=>'Tarjima uchun kim to\'laydi','Either your Zinn Digital® plan, or an API key of your own. There is no free tier — somebody pays a provider for every word.'=>'Zinn Digital® rejangiz yoki o\'zingizning API kalitingiz. Bepul tarif mavjud emas — har bir so\'z uchun provayderga kimdir haq to\'laydi.','My Zinn Digital® plan'=>'Mening Zinn Digital® rejam','My own provider key'=>'Mening shaxsiy provayder kalitim','Site ID'=>'Sayt ID','From your Zinn Digital® dashboard, on this site\'s Translation tab.'=>'Zinn Digital® boshqaruv panelidan, ushbu saytning Tarjima varaqasidan.','Site token'=>'Sayt tokeni','Provider'=>'Provayder','API key'=>'API kaliti','Your key, billed to you by the provider. It is stored on this site and sent only to them.'=>'Sizning kalitingiz, provayder tomonidan sizga hisobga yoziladi. U ushbu saytda saqlanadi va faqat ularga yuboriladi.','Model'=>'Model','Leave empty for the cheapest model that does the job well.'=>'Vazifani yaxshi bajaradigan eng arzon model uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','This site is written in'=>'Ushbu sayt quyidagi tilda yozilgan:','Leave empty to use the site language from WordPress settings.'=>'WordPress sozlamalaridan sayt tilini ishlatish uchun bo\'sh qoldiring.','Languages to publish'=>'Nashr qilinadigan tillar','Each one gets its own web addresses and its own sitemap. Publish only the languages you want indexed.'=>'Har biri oʻz veb-manziliga va oʻz sayt xaritasiga ega boʻladi. Faqat indekslanishini xohlagan tillaringizni eʼlon qiling.','Translate automatically when I publish or update'=>'Men chop etganimda yoki yangilaganimda avtomatik ravishda tarjima qilish','Editing a page marks its translations out of date and they are remade in the background. Editing without changing any words costs nothing.'=>'Sahifani tahrirlash uning tarjimalarini eskirgan deb belgilaydi va ular fonda qayta ishlanadi. Birorta ham so\'zni o\'zgartirmasdan tahrirlash tekin.','What gets translated'=>'Nima tarjima qilinadi','Post types'=>'Xabar turlari','Translate the web addresses too'=>'Veb-manzillarni ham tarjima qiling','French visitors get /fr/a-propos/ rather than /fr/about/. The untranslated address keeps working and redirects, so nothing that was indexed breaks.'=>'Fransiyalik tashrif buyuruvchilar /fr/about/ o‘rniga /fr/a-propos/ sahifasiga o‘tishadi. Tarjima qilinmagan manzil ishlashda davom etadi va yo‘naltiradi, shuning uchun indekslangan hech qanday narsa buzilmaydi.','Translate SEO titles, descriptions and image alt text'=>'SEO sarlavhalari, tavsiflari va rasm alt matnlarini tarjima qilish','Translate categories and tags'=>'Kategoriyalar va teglarni tarjima qilish','Translate navigation menus'=>'Navigatsiya menyularini tarjima qilish','Translate WooCommerce products and attributes'=>'WooCommerce mahsulotlari va atributlarini tarjima qilish','Short descriptions, purchase notes, attribute labels and variation descriptions. Prices, SKUs and stored option values are never touched.'=>'Qisqa tavsiflar, xarid eslatmalari, atribut yorliqlari va oʻzgarish tavsiflari. Narxlar, SKU va saqlangan parametr qiymatlariga hech qachon tegilmaydi.','SEO'=>'SEO','Add hreflang tags'=>'Hreflang teglarini qo‘shish','Tells search engines these pages are the same page in different languages. Leave this on unless another plugin is already doing it.'=>'Qidiruv tizimlariga bu sahifalar turli tillardagi bir xil sahifa ekanligini bildiradi. Boshqa plagin buni allaqachon bajarmayotgan bo\'lsa, buni yoqilgan holda qoldiring.','Publish a sitemap for each language'=>'Har bir til uchun sayt xaritasini e\'lon qilish','Publish llms.txt for each language'=>'Har bir til uchun llms.txt faylini chop etish','A plain-text map of the site that AI answer engines read. They often cannot run JavaScript and may never fetch a sitemap.'=>'Sun\'iy intellekt javob berish traktorlari o\'qiydigan saytning oddiy matnli xaritasi. Ular ko\'pincha JavaScript\'ni ishga tushira olmaydi va sayt xaritasini hech qachon yuklab olmasligi mumkin.','Language switcher'=>'Tilni o\'zgartirgich','Style'=>'Uslub','Colours, spacing and corners are on the Styling tab. Place it with the block, the [zinn_language_switcher] shortcode, or a menu.'=>'Ranglar, oraliqlar va burchaklar Styling (Uslub) tugmasida joylashgan. Uni blok, [zinn_language_switcher] shortkodi yoki menyu yordamida joylashtiring.','Show only these languages'=>'Faqat ushbu tillarni ko‘rsatish','Leave empty to show every language you publish.'=>'Nashr qilgan har bir tilingizni ko‘rsatish uchun bo‘sh qoldiring.','Name each language in its own language'=>'Har bir tilni o\'z tilida nomlang','Deutsch rather than German. Somebody who cannot read the current page cannot read "German" either.'=>'Nemis tili o\'rniga Deutsch. Joriy sahifani o\'qiy olmaydigan odam "German" deb yozilganini ham o\'qiy olmaydi.','Show flags'=>'Bayroqlarni ko‘rsatish','Off by default: a language is not a country, and Arabic and Spanish have no single flag that does not exclude most of their speakers.'=>'Standart bo‘yicha o‘chirilgan: til mamlakat emas, arab va ispan tillarining esa ularning aksariyat so‘zlashuvchilarini chetda qoldirmaydigan yagona bayrog‘i yo‘q.','Include the language being read'=>'O\'qilayotgan tilni kiritish','Include the original language'=>'Asl tilni kiritish','Add it to this menu'=>'Uni ushbu menyuga qo\'shish','Only the menu you name here. Nothing is added to any other menu on the site.'=>'Faqat bu yerda ko\'rsatgan menyuingiz. Saytdagi boshqa hech qanday menyuga hech narsa qo\'shilmaydi.','Accent'=>'Aksent','Background'=>'Fon','Text'=>'Matn','Corner radius'=>'Burchak radiusi','Spacing'=>'Oraliq masofa','Text size'=>'Matn hajmi','Do not add it to a menu'=>'Uni menyuga qo\'shmang','Edit any translation here. An edited translation is kept exactly as you wrote it and is never overwritten when the page is translated again.'=>'Bu yerda istalgan tarjimani tahrirlang. Tahrirlangan tarjima aynan qanday yozgan bo\'lsangiz shunday saqlanadi va sahifa qaytadan tarjima qilinganda hech qachon ustidan yozib yuborilmaydi.','Every language'=>'Har bir til','Search translations'=>'Tarjimalarni qidirish','Filter'=>'Filtrlash','Content'=>'Kontent','Language'=>'Til','Translation'=>'Tarjima','Status'=>'Holat','Save'=>'Saqlash','Nothing translated yet. Publish a language and translation starts in the background.'=>'Hali hech narsa tarjima qilinmagan. Tilni chop eting va tarjima fonda boshlanadi.','These addresses are live. Open any of them to check it, and submit the sitemap index to Google Search Console.'=>'Bu manzillar ishlayotir. Ulardan birini ochib tekshirib ko\'ring va sayt xaritasi ko\'rsatkichini Google Search Console\'ga yuboring.','You are not allowed to edit translations on this site.'=>'Sizga bu saytdagi tarjimalarni tahrirlashga ruxsat etilmagan.','Edited by you — kept'=>'Siz tahrirladingiz — saqlangan','Source changed — will be redone'=>'Manba oʻzgardi — qaytadan bajariladi','Up to date'=>'Yangilangan','Zinn®'=>'Zinn®','Who pays'=>'Kim to\'laydi','Comma separated, for example: fr, de, ar'=>'Vergul bilan ajratilgan, masalan: fr, de, ar','Switcher style'=>'Almashtirgich uslubi','%s — guides and services'=>'%s — qo\'llanmalar va xizmatlar','User guides'=>'Foydalanuvchi qoʻllanmalari','Read the %s user guide'=>'%s foydalanuvchi qo\'llanmasini o\'qing','Hide this'=>'Buni yashirish','Zinn® hosting for WordPress'=>'WordPress uchun Zinn® xostingi','LiteSpeed, daily backups, free migration and a control panel built for people who run more than one site.'=>'LiteSpeed, kunlik zaxira nusxalari, bepul migratsiya va bittadan ortiq sayt yurituvchilar uchun mo\'ljallangan boshqaruv paneli.','The Zinn® marketplace'=>'Zinn® bozori','Buy and sell established sites, domains and link placements, with the money held safely until both sides are happy.'=>'Tayyor saytlar, domenlar va havola joylashtirishni sotib oling va soting, mablag\' esa har ikki tomon rozi bo\'lgunga qadar xavfsiz saqlanadi.','Zinn Hub® — hire people who do this for a living'=>'Zinn Hub® — buni kasb qilgan mutaxassislarni yollang','Our global freelance marketplace: browse over 10,000 ready-made services from writers, designers, developers and SEOs, or post a project and let them bid.'=>'Bizning global frilanserlar bozori: matn yozuvchilar, dizaynerlar, dasturchilar va SEO mutaxassislarining 10 000 dan ortiq tayyor xizmatlarini ko\'rib chiqing yoki loyiha joylashtirib, ularga taklif kiritish imkonini bering.','The API key was rejected. Check that it is still valid and has translation access, then save it again.'=>'API kaliti rad etildi. Uning hali ham yaroqli ekanligini va tarjima qilish huquqiga ega ekanligini tekshirib ko\'ring, so\'ngra uni qayta saqlang.','The provider refused on billing or quota. Nothing was translated. Check the balance and limits on your account with them.'=>'Ta\'minotchi to\'lov yoki kvota sababli rad etdi. Hech narsa tarjima qilmadi. Ulardagi hisobingiz balansini va limitlarni tekshiring.','The translation provider is having a problem at their end. Nothing was translated or charged, and it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Tarjima provayderining o\'z tomonida muammo yuzaga keldi. Hech narsa tarjima qilinmadi yoki haq olinmadi, va keyingi urinishda qaytadan harakat qilinadi.','The translation request failed and we could not tell why. Nothing was saved.'=>'Tarjima soʻrovi bajarilmadi va sababini aniqlab boʻlmadi. Hech narsa saqlanmadi.','Sitemap index'=>'Saytlar xaritasi indeksi','%s sitemap'=>'%s sayt xaritasi','LLM content map'=>'LLM kontent xaritasi','%s LLM content map'=>'%s LLM tarkib xaritasi','Languages published'=>'Nashr qilingan tillar','Site language'=>'Sayt tili','SEO plugin'=>'SEO plagini','No translation provider is set up yet.'=>'Hali hech qanday tarjima provayderi sozlanmagan.','Paste an API key from your chosen provider, or connect the site to a Zinn Digital® account, and translation starts on the next pass.'=>'Tanlangan provayderingizdan API kalitini kiriting yoki saytni Zinn Digital® hisobiga ulang, shunda keyingi bosqichda tarjima boshlanadi.','Translating with your own %s key.'=>'O\'zingizning %s kalitingiz bilan tarjima qilish.','This site is not connected to a Zinn Digital® account, which is fine — your provider bills you directly.'=>'Bu sayt Zinn Digital® hisobiga ulanmagan, bu esa yaxshi — provayderingiz to‘g‘ridan-to‘g‘ri sizga hisob-kitob qiladi.','Not connected to Zinn Digital® yet.'=>'Hali Zinn Digital® ga ulanmagan.','Add this site\'s ID and token from your Zinn Digital® dashboard, or switch to your own provider key to run without an account.'=>'Hisob qaydnomasisiz ishlash uchun Zinn Digital® boshqaruv panelidan ushbu sayt ID raqami va tokenini qo\'shing yoki o\'z provayderingiz kalitiga o\'ting.','Connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Zinn Digital® ga ulangan.','The translation provider is having a problem.'=>'Tarjima provayderida muammo yuzaga keldi.','Translation is paused — your provider needs attention.'=>'Tarjima toʻxtatib turildi — provayderingiz eʼtibor talab qiladi.','Translation has not been set up yet.'=>'Tarjima hali sozlanmagan.','Something went wrong at our end.'=>'Bizning tomonda xatolik yuz berdi.','Check their status page'=>'Ularning holat sahifasini tekshiring','Fix this on your account'=>'Hisobingizdagi buni to\'g\'rilang','Zinn® language switcher'=>'Zinn® tilni o\'zgartirgich','Let visitors read this page in another language.'=>'Tashrif buyuruvchilarga bu sahifani boshqa tilda oʻqishga ruxsat bering.','Title'=>'Sarlavha','Use the plugin setting'=>'Plagin sozlamasidan foydalanish','Dropdown'=>'Ochiladigan roʻyxat','Inline list'=>'Ichki roʻyxat','Pills'=>'Kapsulalar','Minimal text'=>'Minimal matn','Flags and names'=>'Bayroqlar va nomlar','Stacked list'=>'Ustma-ust ro\'yxat','Choose a language'=>'Tilni tanlang','See the Zinn Digital® release notes.'=>'Zinn Digital® chiqarilish eslatmalarini ko\'ring.','The downloaded update failed its integrity check and was not installed.'=>'Yuklab olingan yangilanish yaxlitlik tekshiruvidan o\'tmadi va o\'rnatilmadi.','No DeepL API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'DeepL API kaliti saqlanmagani uchun tarjima qilish uchun hech narsa yo\'q.','DeepL does not translate into %s. Choose Google Gemini or OpenAI for this language, or connect the site to Zinn Digital®.'=>'DeepL %s tiliga tarjima qilmaydi. Ushbu til uchun Google Gemini yoki OpenAI’ni tanlang yoki saytni Zinn Digital®’ga ulang.','DeepL could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'DeepL bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Hech narsa tarjima qilmadi va haq olinmadi; keyingi urinishda qayta harakat qilinadi.','Your DeepL character quota is used up for this period. Translation resumes when it resets, or when you raise the limit on your DeepL account.'=>'DeepL belgilar limiti ushbu davr uchun tugadi. Tarjima limit yangilanganda yoki DeepL hisobingizdagi limitni oshirganingizda davom etadi.','DeepL answered with something we could not read. Nothing was saved.'=>'DeepL biz o\'qiy olmaydigan javob qaytardi. Hech narsa saqlanmadi.','No Google Gemini API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Saqlangan Google Gemini API kaliti yo‘q, shuning uchun tarjima qilish uchun hech qanday ma’lumot mavjud emas.','Google Gemini could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Google Gemini bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Hech narsa tarjima qilmadi va haq olinmadi; u keyingi urinishda qayta harakat qilib ko‘radi.','No OpenAI API key is saved, so there is nothing to translate with.'=>'Hech qanday OpenAI API kaliti saqlanmagani uchun tarjima qilish imkoni yo‘q.','OpenAI could not be reached. Nothing was translated and nothing was charged; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'OpenAI bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Hech narsa tarjima qilmadi va haq olinmadi; u keyingi urinishda qayta harakat qiladi.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®, so there is nothing to collect. Add the Site ID and token, or switch to your own provider key.'=>'Bu sayt Zinn Digital® bilan bog\'lanmagan, shuning uchun yig\'ish uchun hech narsa yo\'q. Sayt identifikatori va tokenni qo\'shing yoki o\'z provayderingiz kalitiga o\'ting.','This site is not connected to Zinn Digital®.'=>'Bu sayt Zinn Digital® bilan bogʻlanmagan.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Nothing was sent; it will try again on the next pass.'=>'Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Hech narsa yuborilmadi; keyingi urinishda qayta harakat qilinadi.','Translation is paused on this site. Check the account is up to date on your Zinn Digital® dashboard.'=>'Ushbu saytda tarjima vaqtincha toʻxtatilgan. Zinn Digital® boshqaruv panelida hisob qaydnomasi yangilanganligini tekshiring.','Zinn Digital® rejected this site\'s token. Copy it again from the site\'s Translation tab on your dashboard.'=>'Zinn Digital® ushbu sayt tokenini rad etdi. Uni boshqaruv panelingizdagi saytning Tarjima (Translation) yorlig\'idan qaytadan nusxalang.','Zinn Digital® could not be reached. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® bilan bog‘lanib bo‘lmadi. Saytingiz o‘zida mavjud bo‘lgan tarjimalarni yetkazib berishda davom etmoqda.','Zinn Digital® answered with something we could not read. Your site keeps serving the translations it already has.'=>'Zinn Digital® o‘qiy olmaydigan javob qaytardi. Saytingiz o‘zida mavjud bo‘lgan tarjimalarni yetkazib berishda davom etmoqda.']];